{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2023-06-08 08:00:00', 'title': 'ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP EXTENDS COLLABORATION TO CAPTURE\u202fCRITICAL OCEAN CONSERVATION DATA ONBOARD SHIPS', 'text': 'OCEANSCOPE PROGRAM RENEWAL – ANNOUNCED ON WORLD OCEANS DAY – BUILDS ON DECADES-LONG PUBLIC-PRIVATE COLLABORATION WITH THE UNIVERSITY OF MIAMI, NASA, AND NOAA TO ADDRESS OCEAN HEALTH ISSUES. MIAMI , JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP (NYSE:\xa0RCL) STRENGTHENING A DECADES-LONG COMMITMENT TO OCEAN CONSERVATION AND ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH EFFORTS, ROYAL CARIBBEAN GROUP TODAY ANNOUNCED A FOUR-YEAR EXTENSION OF ITS INVESTMENT IN OCEANSCOPE, AN OPEN-SOURCE DATA PROGRAM THAT PROVIDES SCIENTISTS WITH CRITICAL INFORMATION TO STUDY CLIMATE AND OCEAN CONSERVATION.'}